# Sprint 0 — Production invariant freeze

**Duration:** 3–5 working days
**Goal:** Freeze the production rules before touching code aggressively.

This sprint prevents a common mistake: polishing UI or adding more fields before the safety model is explicit.

## Deliverables

| Deliverable                   | Description                                                                         |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Production invariant document | The final safety rules listed above, approved by engineering/product                |
| Field risk matrix             | All 8 GBP sync sections ranked by write risk                                        |
| Rollout gate checklist        | What must be true before pilot, beta, and GA                                        |
| Test strategy                 | Fake Google, replay, contract, failure-injection strategy                           |
| Ownership map                 | Which fields are Core-owned, Google-owned, bidirectional, review-only, or read-only |

## Field risk classification

| Section                       |  Risk level | Why                                                          |
| ----------------------------- | ----------: | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Profile name/address/category |   Very high | Public identity and SEO impact                               |
| Regular hours                 |        High | Operational impact; wrong hours hurt customers               |
| Special hours                 |        High | Holiday/service exceptions are easy to overwrite             |
| Attributes                    |        High | Dynamic, category/country-dependent                          |
| Food menus                    |        High | Nested, business-sensitive, likely normalization differences |
| Service items                 | Medium-high | Structured, possibly Google-specific                         |
| Service areas                 |      Medium | Location/business model impact                               |
| Basic phone/website           |      Medium | Important but easier to validate                             |

## Sprint 0 acceptance criteria

```text
All fields assigned to a risk tier
All fields assigned to an ownership policy
All write groups identified
All release gates documented
All production invariants approved
All unknown Google behavior listed as contract-test target
```

