Stage 1: internal restaurants only
Stage 2: 3–5 friendly pilot restaurants
Stage 3: 10–20 restaurants, manual publish only
Stage 4: all restaurants, manual publish only
Stage 5: outbound candidate recommendations enabled
Stage 6: scheduled refresh enabled
Stage 7: high-risk sections enabled after monitoring
```

Even though this is final production architecture, rollout should still be staged.

