# Biggest risks and mitigations

| Risk                                                                   |    Severity | Mitigation                                                       |
| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------: | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Field-level decision accidentally overwrites section-level Google data |    Critical | Section-level planner, mask builders, destructive write detector |
| Google normalizes values and creates false drift                       |        High | Semantic canonicalizers and golden comparator tests              |
| Two admins publish conflicting changes                                 |        High | Restaurant/provider lock and idempotency                         |
| Core write races with Google refresh                                   |        High | Queue and lock discipline                                        |
| Quota exceeded during bulk publish                                     |        High | Per-location throttle and grouped writes                         |
| OAuth token revoked                                                    |        High | Reauth state, error mapper, operator UX                          |
| No sandbox for safe testing                                            |        High | Fake adapter, validateOnly, replay tests                         |
| Attributes change by category/country                                  | Medium-high | Attribute metadata refresh and unsupported-field handling        |
| Menu payload causes destructive replacement                            |        High | Menu-specific planner, preflight, high-risk confirmation         |
| Audit trail too technical for operators                                |      Medium | Recent publishes panel with human-readable summaries             |

